# Play case chat

## Where conversation lives (Steve — single surface)

| UI | Chat? |
|----|-------|
| **`SceneOrderCommandDock`** on scene | **Yes** — expand via message icon; `dockChatExpanded` + embedded `CaseSessionThread` (`messagesOnly`) |
| Sidebar `CaseContextPanel` | **No Thread tab** — do not set `showChatTab` in Play |
| Differential Practice | Separate mode — `DifferentialFloatingChat` |

Do not add a second Play chat path (sidebar tab + dock quick-reply was removed for this reason).

## Patient mode (stethoscope)

| Control | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Stethoscope toggle | `SceneOrderCommandDock` header |
| State | `chatPatientMode` + `chatPatientModeRef` in `Play.jsx` — reset on `caseData.id` change |
| Off (default) | Dock text → **tutor** (`chatMode: 'tutor'`) |
| On (gold) | → **patient_sim** |
| Slash | `/pt` patient · `/ch …` saves note · dock `submitOrderCommand` |

Patient replies: **direct dialogue only** — `sanitizePatientReplyForDisplay` + server prompt (no `*(actions)*` or parentheses). Stripped stage text saved to `.patient-stage-cache/` for future video — **never shown in chat**. TTS: tap **▶**; auto-play off by default.

## Chat session expired

Server keeps sessions **in RAM only** (`caseChatSessions` in `server/index.js`). Lost on API restart (~every `npm run dev`) or **2h** idle.

Client must auto-recover: `sendCaseChatMessage(..., recover: { caseData, chatMode })` → retry once after `/api/case-chat/start`.

## Order matching vs chat

Non-order text in dock → chat. Order synonyms: `orderCommandAutocomplete.js`.
